      // (data/prompts.json → legalRisksReview) explicitly tells the AI:
      // "Use the EXACT 'id' property from the provided JSON array (e.g.
      // '_ELI_LR_5'). Do NOT invent an id." Pre-fix this was being
      // flattened to a plain string, so the AI never saw IDs and LOCATE
      // had no anchor to jump to. (Bug fix 2026-05-11.)
