  // start (eli.host.readTextWithAnchors inserts every paragraph as
  // _ELI_LR_<n>); the AI gets the JSON array of {id, text}; the AI
  // returns the matching id. If LOCATE can't find the bookmark, that
  // means either (a) the AI didn't follow instructions and returned
  // a bad id (engine logs via wrongness capture), or (b) the user
  // edited the doc enough to wipe bookmarks. Both should fail loudly,
  // not silently fall back to fuzzy text search.
